Realized plus unrealized result differs from cash flows and remaining market value.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight unrealized-gains --to 2024-03-31 --format json <<'LEDGER'
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.000 FUND
account Assets:Bank
account Assets:Broker
account Income:CapitalGains

P 2024-03-01 FUND 100 USD

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Broker  10 FUND {100 USD}
  Assets:Bank  -1000 USD

2024-02-01 Sale with understated realized gain
  Assets:Broker  -4 FUND {{400 USD}} @@ 700 USD
  Assets:Bank  700 USD
  Income:CapitalGains  -200 USD
LEDGER

